# Pass "avec-pickletools": stages PickleTools/InterfaceScale beside the mod, so scenario 16's 150% click
# lands on the Workshop Pickle as it ships, no -PickleSrc and no modified Pickle to keep in sync by hand.
#
#   scripts/Run-PickleWsl.ps1 -Mod ArchitectStudio -DepMap wsl-deps.avec-pickletools.map -Filter '16-language-review.feature'
#
# The repair is a Harmony postfix on TagStore.Record, applied to every click of the run regardless of which
# step set the interface scale, so nothing in 16-language-review.feature itself changes: it still calls
# "I set the interface scale to {int} percent" (ModSteps.cs, ArchitectStudio's own), which already does the
# full Options-page equivalent. Only the click that follows behaves differently.
#
# `path:` names a folder of the PickleTools repository (relative to the collection's root); the folder's own
# About.xml packageId must match. See PickleTools/InterfaceScale/README.md - in particular the "delete this"
# list for when RimWorks/Rimworld-Pickle pull request 23 merges.
nelim.pickletools.interfacescale   path:PickleTools/InterfaceScale/Mod
